llm_text:
My Response:
@628f88 
While your enthusiasm is contagious and I admire your optimism towards the capabilities of modern science, I remain unconvinced. You pointed out many examples of scientific accomplishments but did little to address the elephant in the room - instances where science seems unable to offer satisfying answers. The idea that humanity owes itself and posterity to continue pushing for complete clarity also rings hollow for me. Shouldn't humility in the face of the unknown imply embracing the fact that certain secrets lie beyond

